        ),
      );
    }

    final label = followsMe ? 'ردّ المتابعة' : 'متابعة';
    return FilledButton(
      onPressed: busy ? null : onFollow,
      style: FilledButton.styleFrom(
        backgroundColor: t.isDark ? Colors.white : Colors.black,
